无法确认执行上下文\",\"未提供网络流量数据，无法排除数据外传可能性\",\"分诊置信度较低（0.5-0.6），且明确标注证据不足\",\"incident_diagnosis_not_case_investigation\",\"structure_scope_sources_checked_not_truth_proven\",\"model_view_has_omitted_fields\"],\"summary\":\"事件汇聚显示主机 win-c23 上的用户 temp-svc 在 2026-11-06T05:30:00 执行了禁用登录审计的操作（auditpol.exe），随后在 30 秒后（2026-11-06T05:30:30）对安全日志文件 Security.evtx 进行了截断（清零）。两个告警（N2_S19, N2_S20）均标记为高严重度。现有分诊（N2_S12, N2_S13）均判定为 needs_review，指出缺乏授权证据且存在潜在攻击链（先禁用审计后清零日志），但未发现明确的因果证明或授权工单。\"}}],\"limitations\":[],\"role\":\"prior_analysis\"},{\"alert_ids\":[\"bc6c2562-3cde-509c-b062-0a3510cd5312\"],\"items\":[{\"id\":\"N3_S15\",\"value\":\"2026-11-06T05:30:00+00:00\"},{\"id\":\"N3_S17\",\"value\":{\"description\":null,\"event_time\":\"2026-11-06T05:30:00+00:00\",\"original_vendor\":null,\"severity\":\"high\",\"source_alert_id\":\"63ea8e22-66b7-5709-874e-3a4cbdbfeffa\",\"title\":\"禁用登录审计的命令已启动\",\"vendor_alert_id\":\"IE-26-02-1\"}},{\"id\":\"N3_S20\",\"value\":[{\"asset_match_state\":\"not_checked\",\"namespace\":\"source:ie-audit-20261106-a1\",\"normalized_value\":\"win-c23\",\"object_role\":\"entity\",\"object_type\":\"host\",\"raw_value\":\"win-c23\"},{\"asset_match_state\":\"not_checked\",\"namespace\":\"source:ie-audit-20261106-a1\",\"normalized_value\":\"temp-svc\",\"object_role\":\"entity\",\"object_type\":\"user\",\"raw_value\":\"temp-svc\"}]}],\"limitations\":[],\"role\":\"source_label\"},{\"alert_ids\":[\"c403a865-6f32-5c6f-86bc-db102d45bbfc\"],\"items\":[{\"id\":\"N3_S16\",\"value\":\"2026-11-06T05:30:30+00:00\"},{\"id\":\"N3_S18\",\"value\":{\"description\":null,\"event_time\":\"2026-11-06T05:30:30+00:00\",\"original_vendor\":null,\"severity\":\"high\",\"source_alert_id\":\"13adba81-ac1b-52e2-b4b1-1caa70477c04\",\"title\":\"安全日志文件清零\",\"vendor_alert_id\":\"IE-26-02-2\"}}],\"limitations\":[],\"role\":\"source_label\"},{\"alert_ids\":[\"bc6c2562-3cde-509c-b062-0a3510cd5312\",\"c403a865-6f32-5c6f-86bc-db102d45bbfc\"],\"items\":[{\"id\":\"N3_S19\",\"value\":{\"description\":null,\